Trimmed real data from Homebrew, fetched 2026-09-26 (ruling T1):

- http/cask.json.gz: 27 of the 7,761 casks of https://formulae.brew.sh/api/cask.json
  (26 font casks and one app), each with its artifact list cut to 3 entries and its
  platform list cut to 2. Built by formulae.brew.sh from the Homebrew/homebrew-cask
  repository at commit 81097d41aaaa8d6927a697667b01112ab1817a96.
- http/cask_renames.json: 7 of the 228 entries of
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/homebrew-cask/main/cask_renames.json
- http/cask_tap_migrations.json: 3 of the 45 entries of
  https://formulae.brew.sh/api/cask_tap_migrations.json
- snapshot/ is what the collector's fetch() writes from http/; expected.jsonl is
  what its parse() returns for snapshot/.

